{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CgKPNCS8viHqHT47mWcYj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The change is commit `c21a7cbf` (PR #6346, \"TRUNK-6683: Skip full-text search with drugs when a concept is provided\"). It adds `concept == null` to the guard around the ConceptName full-text lookup in `HibernateConceptDAO.newDrugQuery`. When a concept is supplied, the `ConceptName` search no longer runs. The drugs of that concept still match through the `concept.conceptId` clause, and drug-name and code matching are unchanged. The service layer only passes arguments through, so the fix lives entirely in the DAO.\n\nEvidence, best first:\n\n1. The fix itself: the guard is now `searchDrugConceptNames && concept == null`, with a comment explaining the skip (`openmrs-core/api/src/main/java/org/openmrs/api/db/hibernate/HibernateConceptDAO.java:1581-1593`, and the `concept.conceptId` filter at 1601-1603).\n2. The commit diff that introduced that one-line change (`openmrs-core`, commit `c21a7cbfa2c9f67c1991372a343217e949e04f44`, hunk at `HibernateConceptDAO.java` line 1577).\n3. The pull request that carries the commit: `openmrs-core` PR #6346.\n4. New regression tests for both branches: `getDrugs_shouldNotSearchConceptNamesWhenConceptIsSupplied` and `getDrugs_shouldSearchConceptNamesWhenNoConceptIsSupplied` (`openmrs-core/api/src/test/java/org/openmrs/api/db/hibernate/HibernateConceptDAOTest.java`, about lines 125-158; I did not re-read these lines, so the exact range is approximate).\n5. Test fixture data: concept 20 \"ZEBRACONCEPT\" with drug \"Placebo-X\" (`openmrs-core/api/src/test/resources/org/openmrs/api/db/hibernate/include/HibernateConceptTestDataSet.xml`, about lines 46-49).\n6. The unchanged service pass-through, `ConceptServiceImpl.getDrugs(...)` (`openmrs-core/api/src/main/java/org/openmrs/api/impl/ConceptServiceImpl.java:1579-1581`).\n7. The public service signature the question refers to (`openmrs-core/api/src/main/java/org/openmrs/api/ConceptService.java:1686-1687`).\n8. The ticket: TRUNK-6683.\n\nNote that this is a behavior change: with a concept supplied, a phrase that matches only a concept name no longer pulls in other concepts' drugs. The new test asserts exactly that.\n\nI used the repository name `github.com/openmrs/openmrs-core` for Falkon calls, since the bare name was not found. The cited paths use the `openmrs-core/...` form you asked for.\n\n```json\n[\n  {\"path\": \"openmrs-core/api/src/main/java/org/openmrs/api/db/hibernate/HibernateConceptDAO.java\", \"startLine\": 1581, \"endLine\": 1593},\n  {\"path\": \"openmrs-core/api/src/main/java/org/openmrs/api/db/hibernate/HibernateConceptDAO.java\", \"startLine\": 1601, \"endLine\": 1603},\n  {\"repo\": \"openmrs-core\", \"commit\": \"c21a7cbfa2c9f67c1991372a343217e949e04f44\"},\n  {\"repo\": \"openmrs-core\", \"pr\": 6346},\n  {\"path\": \"openmrs-core/api/src/test/java/org/openmrs/api/db/hibernate/HibernateConceptDAOTest.java\", \"startLine\": 125, \"endLine\": 158},\n  {\"path\": \"openmrs-core/api/src/test/resources/org/openmrs/api/db/hibernate/include/HibernateConceptTestDataSet.xml\", \"startLine\": 46, \"endLine\": 49},\n  {\"path\": \"openmrs-core/api/src/main/java/org/openmrs/api/impl/ConceptServiceImpl.java\", \"startLine\": 1579, \"endLine\": 1581},\n  {\"path\": \"openmrs-core/api/src/main/java/org/openmrs/api/ConceptService.java\", \"startLine\": 1686, \"endLine\": 1687},\n  {\"ticket\": \"TRUNK-6683\"}\n]\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5273,"cache_read_input_tokens":16458,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5273},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"aef34a34-f80a-424a-b35